<Layout title="Privacy"><h1>Privacy, plainly.</h1><p>Effective 14 October 2026. This static site has no accounts, forms, cookies set by our code or analytics scripts. It does not collect outcome reports.</p><section><h2>Requests & external services</h2><p>GitHub Pages delivers the site and may process request metadata such as IP addresses under <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub’s privacy statement</a>. Fonts load from Google Fonts, which receives font requests and network metadata. External links use their own privacy policies.</p><h2>Published data</h2><p>Findings concern public website behaviour, timestamps and domain-level observations. Fixtures are fictional. Do not submit personal data, account details or credentials in public GitHub issues. Future outcome reporting is intended to use enums without user content or full URLs; it is not operating on this site.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/legacy-ev/preflight/issues">Contact via GitHub issues</a> for questions or correction requests. Public issues are visible to other people.</p></section></Layout>
